  "slug": "contract-formation-04-mechanism",
  "title": "Proposal and a supplied milestone — journeys on two lanes and a clock's mark",
  "titleEs": "Vencimiento de propuesta — Mecanismo o relación explicada",
  "category": "contract-formation",
  "categoryName": "Formación del contrato",
  "motif": "Vencimiento de propuesta",
  "treatment": "mechanism",
  "family": "spatial-mechanism",
  "description": "A time-lane diagram: Party A's lane and Party B's lane, the supplied order running along both, and an editable clock as a component of its own. The proposal (●) travels on its solid line from A's lane to B's lane and the response (◆) from B's lane back to A's; the events are marked on the lanes with their fictional time labels in the supplied order. The clock's hand turns one step per row and reaches its single mark at the milestone's row, where a solid rule joins the lanes (the supplied milestone, with its time label). Only the supplied relationships are drawn and captioned; a tracer follows the supplied traversal order and the focus element swells. Events before and after the rule are positions in the supplied order only; no consequence is shown or inferred.",
  "tags": [
    "proposal",
    "response",
    "milestone",
    "clock",
    "lanes",
    "sequence",
    "relations",
    "tracer"
  ],
